const String userAgreementVersion = '2026-09-30';

const String userAgreementText = '''VITALINK USER AGREEMENT AND PRIVACY NOTICE

VitaLink is a personal information storage and sharing tool. It is not a medical provider, insurer, emergency service, or licensed advisory service. VitaLink does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or coverage recommendations. Call 911 or local emergency services in an emergency.

YOUR INFORMATION

You are responsible for keeping the information on your device accurate and current. Most profile information is stored locally on your device. VitaLink may temporarily process information you choose to scan, transfer, or share. The encrypted emergency profile used by VitaLink's emergency-access features is the limited profile record retained for that purpose.

Medical personnel, caregivers, agents, and others should not rely on VitaLink as the only source of information. Insurance documents may not reflect current coverage.

ACCESS TO VITALINK

Continued access requires either a valid connection to a participating agent or a valid personal access code. Personal access codes are delivered by email after they are issued. Account recovery may verify your email address or phone number, but it does not restore information stored only on a lost device.

Access described as one-time remains available for as long as the VitaLink service operates and the applicable access sponsor remains valid. If an agent stops using VitaLink, leaves the business, or transfers a book of business, you may be asked to confirm a successor agent, enter another valid agent code, or enter a personal access code.

AGENT RELATIONSHIP AND MESSAGES

Only you may confirm whether an agent is your current insurance agent and whether you are a current client or a prospect. An agent may not make these choices for you.

Agent messaging is available only to confirmed clients who separately consent. Messages may include coverage reminders and enrollment-period outreach from a licensed insurance agent who may be compensated if you enroll in a plan. Messaging consent is optional and may be withdrawn at any time. Prospects and caregivers do not receive agent messages through this feature.

CAREGIVER AND FAMILY SHARING

You control which profile and sections are shared with a caregiver or family member. A complete share code must be given directly to that person. Shared profile packages are encrypted before leaving your device, are temporary, and are removed from VitaLink's transfer system after delivery or expiration.

You may stop future updates at any time. Information already received on another person's device cannot be recalled. The recipient may delete their local copy. If your profile-sharing relationship ends, the recipient's copy is disabled from receiving future updates.

DEVICES, TRANSFERS, AND RECOVERY

Your account may be limited to an active device. During recovery, you may identify an old device as replaced, lost, or stolen. A normally replaced device is disabled, but its local VitaLink profiles remain on that device until you choose to erase them or remove the app. If you report a device lost or stolen, VitaLink will disable it and clear its local VitaLink profile data when the disabled app reconnects. Screenshots, exports, backups, or information copied outside VitaLink cannot be recalled.

Account recovery does not recreate medications, doctors, insurance information, images, or other records stored only on the old device. Use VitaLink's encrypted Transfer Profile to New Device feature before replacing a device when the old device is available. Temporary transfer packages expire within six hours and are deleted after a successful transfer or by scheduled expiration cleanup.

PRIVACY AND SECURITY

VitaLink uses access controls, encryption, and audit records designed to protect account, consent, device, and sharing activity. No system can guarantee absolute security or uninterrupted availability. You authorize VitaLink to process information as needed to provide features you request, including emergency access, document processing, device transfer, caregiver sharing, and information you direct VitaLink to send to your agent.

Health and consumer information may be protected by federal or state privacy and breach-notification laws. VitaLink will handle information according to its Privacy Policy and applicable law. Information you intentionally disclose to another person may be redisclosed by that person and may no longer receive the same legal protection.

SERVICE LIMITATIONS

VitaLink is provided as-is to the extent permitted by law. Features may change as needed for security, legal compliance, platform requirements, or service operation. If you do not agree to this agreement and the Privacy Policy, you may not use VitaLink.''';

